        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hoppin is the name under which the Flemish government indicates transport hubs for passenger transport that meet fixed (quality) requirements. Important aspects are recognisability (application of the Hoppin house style), accessibility (for all users irrespective of disability, age, etc.), minimum equipment (for example bicycle sheds, information supports, etc.), alignment with mobility plans, etc."
      }
